      "id": "claim_9ab29eee732f4fa6a7135750637a8fcd",
      "statement": "The frontend uses a local-first sync architecture: runGlobalSync syncs tastings, custom beans, saved beans, and brew recipes via per-table sync modules, skipping while offline or when a sync is already in progress.",
